{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>If he spits.</b> It is known from the forms of doubled [roots], and the witness is the dagesh in the qof. His spit here too causes impurity, for the flow comes from the organs that are joined. And it is not a person's habit to spit in the face of his fellow; rather, it is unintentional, for the zav cast his spit and it fell upon the pure person."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:16.705265989Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}